1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,647
Year of the Tiger, wait!

2
00:00:02,697 --> 00:00:05,905
Today is a clash day for you.

3
00:00:05,955 --> 00:00:09,950
Here's how to get through it calmly.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,381
Today, 18 November, is a Monkey day

5
00:00:13,431 --> 00:00:17,303
opposite the Tiger in the zodiac circle.

6
00:00:17,353 --> 00:00:19,950
Some days don't go to plan.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,617
And that's okay.

8
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:24,533
Everyone has days like this.

9
00:00:24,583 --> 00:00:27,554
A quiet day is not a bad day.

10
00:00:27,604 --> 00:00:29,950
It is a day to breathe.

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,117
Be careful today: you can be impulsive

12
00:00:33,167 --> 00:00:36,367
or impatient with slower-moving people.

13
00:00:36,417 --> 00:00:38,283
Pause before you react.

14
00:00:38,333 --> 00:00:39,950
Be kind to yourself.

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,046
Be gentle with the people you love

16
00:00:44,096 --> 00:00:46,215
and with yourself.

17
00:00:46,265 --> 00:00:49,950
And lean on a friend you trust.

18
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,045
At work and with money

19
00:00:52,095 --> 00:00:54,521
take small, careful steps.

20
00:00:54,571 --> 00:00:57,569
Finish one thing, then the next.

21
00:00:57,619 --> 00:00:59,950
Take a deep breath first.

22
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,712
Slow is still moving forward.

23
00:01:02,762 --> 00:01:05,950
Every quiet day makes you stronger

24
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,569
and brighter days

25
00:01:07,619 --> 00:01:09,950
are already on their way.

26
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,648
Rest well tonight.

27
00:01:11,698 --> 00:01:13,629
Tomorrow is a new day

28
00:01:13,679 --> 00:01:15,705
